      "value": "Cant argue with that, like taking the headset off to eat but still talk and interact with my friends. I'm no programmer but doesn't seem to be hard to have duel controls always on anyway heck in VR if you move the mouse still it turns you so just keep wasd and cz enabled too. as well also once its in ideal/ not tracking head tilt up and down.",
