  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-12-24T15:36:52.460Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So whenever I have my headset off in VR my viewpoint on my desktop screen goes somewhere else, it moves my view point into the floor making me unable to see anything in desktop while not having the VR headset on, this function was added with chair's patch, could we have back our normal viewpoints while headset is off?\nBecause even turning off the idle of headset in steamVR didn't seem to fix it, my view point would go somewhere else the moment I took the headset off and stood in idle for like 15 sec, I wanna be able to still move/see while I have headset off using the keyboard like I did before.",
